# Strings

A structured collection of string problems solved in Python as part of my DSA preparation.

This section focuses on understanding string manipulation, common problem-solving patterns, and efficient algorithms through LeetCode practice.

## Topics Covered

- String Fundamentals
- String Traversal
- Hashing & Frequency Counting
- Two Pointers
- Sliding Window
- Stack-Based String Problems
- String Manipulation
- Pattern Matching
- Palindromes
- Greedy Algorithms
- Dynamic Programming

